           combination with the _n_o_-_d_f modifier to ensure unique IP identi‐
           fiers.

     _m_i_n_-_t_t_l ⟨_n_u_m_b_e_r⟩
           Enforces a minimum TTL for matching IP packets.

     _m_a_x_-_m_s_s ⟨_n_u_m_b_e_r⟩
           Enforces a maximum MSS for matching TCP packets.

     _s_e_t_-_t_o_s ⟨_s_t_r_i_n_g⟩ | ⟨_n_u_m_b_e_r⟩
           Enforces a _T_O_S for matching IP packets.  _T_O_S may be given as one of
           _c_r_i_t_i_c_a_l, _i_n_e_t_c_o_n_t_r_o_l, _l_o_w_d_e_l_a_y, _n_e_t_c_o_n_t_r_o_l, _t_h_r_o_u_g_h_p_u_t,
