           The _b_i_t_m_a_s_k option applies the network portion of the redirection
           address to the address to be modified (source with _n_a_t, destination
           with _r_d_r).

     _r_a_n_d_o_m
           The _r_a_n_d_o_m option selects an address at random within the defined
           block of addresses.

